sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin as "Admin"
    participant UI as "Interface: UI"
    participant API as "mainController: Controller"
    participant Inv as "inventoryService: Service"
    participant App as "applicationService: Service"
    participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
    Admin->>UI: Scan/select near-expiry batches
    UI->>+API: GET suggestions / POST batch discount rule
    API->>Inv: Find active batches and available quantities
    Inv->>+DB: Read expiry, OnHand, Reserved and status
    DB-->>-Inv: Candidate batches
    Inv-->>UI: Candidates and remaining-life data
    Admin->>UI: Configure SKU/Category rule, percent or fixed amount
    UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/shelf-life-discounts
    API->>App: Validate non-overlap, version and authority
    App->>DB: Save versioned rule and audit
    API-->>-UI: Rule published
    Note over App,DB: Allocation applies MLOR/batch eligibility first; this rule prices selected fragments afterward.


